n challenges, and seize opportunities to win big.\n\n{424176543836346}\n\n- **Mixed Reality Mode** -  Prefer solo play? Try Mixed Reality Mode - perfect for gaming in your own space.\n\n{1258463678752981}\n\n# Vegas is coming home! ", "short_description": "Vegas is coming home! Step into a thrilling VR/MR casino filled with Slot Machines, Texas Hold'em Poker, high-stakes Blackjack, and real-time Roulette. Join now to win big, hit the jackpot, and capture the essence of Vegas from anywhere in the world. Your journey into card games and casino fun starts here"}]}, "developer_name": "iLab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vegasbillionaire.centurygame.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Century Games", "support_website_url": "https://centurygames.helpshift.com/hc/en/147-vegas-billionaire-casino/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://www.centurygames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25605411925803608"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620921_868114046205724_6752730545418452681_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VFN_xybqaU8Q7kNvwFGgYlW&_nc_oc=AdpKMFWZKg_VwoTJNFsjIVRm92e8lgcLNTX0klKA_g7DQ36Rk5D6